{"id":"7099f3791c655614","group":"88","path":"88/88-ex-addition-pr.md","title":"Addition is Primitive Recursive","display":"ex-addition-pr — Addition is Primitive Recursive","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-ex-addition-pr","aliases":["88-ex-addition-pr"],"display":"ex-addition-pr — Addition is Primitive Recursive","depends_on":["[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[88-df-zero-function]]","[[88-df-successor-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-ex-addition-pr"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-ex-addition-pr</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-addition-pr — Addition is Primitive Recursive"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2f808bc294509a7d\" href=\"?note=2f808bc294509a7d\" title=\"88-df-primitive-recursive\">88-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"69f9994fe732757d\" href=\"?note=69f9994fe732757d\" title=\"88-df-zero-function\">88-df-zero-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0f63c32733077b50\" href=\"?note=0f63c32733077b50\" title=\"88-df-successor-function\">88-df-successor-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{add}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\operatorname{add}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{add}(x,y)=x+y\">\\(\\operatorname{add}(x,y)=x+y\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}(\\operatorname{add})\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRec}(\\operatorname{add})\\)</span> (primitive-recursive predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2f808bc294509a7d\" href=\"?note=2f808bc294509a7d\" title=\"88-df-primitive-recursive\">88-df-primitive-recursive</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}addition\\text{-}pr} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}(\\operatorname{add})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}addition\\text{-}pr} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}(\\operatorname{add})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>定义方式：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{add}(x,0)=x\">\\(\\operatorname{add}(x,0)=x\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{add}(x,S(y))=S(\\operatorname{add}(x,y))\">\\(\\operatorname{add}(x,S(y))=S(\\operatorname{add}(x,y))\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>加法由递归定义生成</li>\n<li>原始递归函数的基本例子</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"2f808bc294509a7d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-zero-function","status":"resolved","id":"69f9994fe732757d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-zero-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-successor-function","status":"resolved","id":"0f63c32733077b50","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-successor-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"2f808bc294509a7d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PrimRec}(\\operatorname{add})$ (primitive-recursive predicate, see [[88-df-primitive-recursive]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{add}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{add}(x,y)=x+y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimRec}(\\operatorname{add})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}addition\\text{-}pr} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}(\\operatorname{add})","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{add}(x,0)=x","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{add}(x,S(y))=S(\\operatorname{add}(x,y))","display":false}],"bytes":870,"backlinks":[{"id":"360802c5c9c1d405","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["2f808bc294509a7d","69f9994fe732757d","0f63c32733077b50"]}